      "versionNonce": 1110425155,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794775884821,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Python injects: '\", \"parameters\": {'\n2. For each (param, info) in spec:\n   • Inject key: '\"<param>\": '\n   • Dispatch by param_info['type']:\n     - boolean -> select_boolean_value\n     - number/int -> select_number_value\n     - string -> select_string_value\n   • Inject ', ' between parameters\n3. Re-encode ratchet keeps BPE canonical",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Python injects: '\", \"parameters\": {'\n2. For each (param, info) in spec:\n   • Inject key: '\"<param>\": '\n   • Dispatch by param_info['type']:\n     - boolean -> select_boolean_value\n     - number/int -> select_number_value\n     - string -> select_string_value\n   • Inject ', ' between parameters\n3. Re-encode ratchet keeps BPE canonical",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aT",
      "autoResize": true
    },
