      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794775884821,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Pre-encodes all registry keys:\n  valid_seq = [encode(k) for k in registry]\n• At each step (up to max_len + 1):\n  - Checks which seqs match generated_tokens\n  - Adds seq[len(generated)] to allowed_tokens\n  - If a full name matches (is_complete=True),\n    adds closure_id ('\"') to allowed_tokens\n• Model logits pick among valid branches\n• Stops when model selects '\"'\n\nGuarantee:\n• 0% hallucinated function names\n• Model decides (no 'if keyword in prompt')",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Pre-encodes all registry keys:\n  valid_seq = [encode(k) for k in registry]\n• At each step (up to max_len + 1):\n  - Checks which seqs match generated_tokens\n  - Adds seq[len(generated)] to allowed_tokens\n  - If a full name matches (is_complete=True),\n    adds closure_id ('\"') to allowed_tokens\n• Model logits pick among valid branches\n• Stops when model selects '\"'\n\nGuarantee:\n• 0% hallucinated function names\n• Model decides (no 'if keyword in prompt')",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "ak",
      "autoResize": true
    },
