      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "   • Checks periodic token cycles of period 1..6: hypothetical[-p:] == hypothetical[-2p:-p].\n   • Immediately breaks infinite repetition loops common in 0.6B models.",
