      "text": "Why Decode -> Re-encode ('The Ratchet')?",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why Decode -> Re-encode ('The Ratchet')?",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b05",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "294b1d8b-1bc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 58,
      "y": 1165,
      "width": 427.18,
      "height": 175.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 43831,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 8387725,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794775884821,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "working_ids = encode(decode(working_ids) + prefix)\n\n• Byte-level BPE is context-sensitive: boundary\n  characters merge differently depending on neighbors\n  (e.g., leading space 'Ġ' tokens).\n• Concatenating raw token IDs of injected JSON\n  punctuation creates non-canonical sequences the\n  model never saw in training, degrading logits.\n• Re-encoding the full string keeps token boundaries\n  100% canonical at every step.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "working_ids = encode(decode(working_ids) + prefix)\n\n• Byte-level BPE is context-sensitive: boundary\n  characters merge differently depending on neighbors\n  (e.g., leading space 'Ġ' tokens).\n• Concatenating raw token IDs of injected JSON\n  punctuation creates non-canonical sequences the\n  model never saw in training, degrading logits.\n• Re-encoding the full string keeps token boundaries\n  100% canonical at every step.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b06",
      "autoResize": true
    },
