      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Environment: uv sync (pyproject.toml + editable\n  local workspace llm_sdk + moulinette)\n• Storage: goinfre symlinked .venv, UV_CACHE_DIR,\n  HF_HOME (Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B weights)\n• Makefile targets:\n  - make install  -> uv sync via goinfre symlink\n  - make run      -> uv run python -m src\n  - make debug    -> python3 -m pdb -m src\n  - make lint     -> flake8 (79 chars) + mypy\n  - make lint-strict -> mypy --strict",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Environment: uv sync (pyproject.toml + editable\n  local workspace llm_sdk + moulinette)\n• Storage: goinfre symlinked .venv, UV_CACHE_DIR,\n  HF_HOME (Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B weights)\n• Makefile targets:\n  - make install  -> uv sync via goinfre symlink\n  - make run      -> uv run python -m src\n  - make debug    -> python3 -m pdb -m src\n  - make lint     -> flake8 (79 chars) + mypy\n  - make lint-strict -> mypy --strict",
